Package: com.sui827.connectbridge
Name: ConnectBridge
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Spotify Connect to AirPlay bridge
 Makes the iPhone a Spotify Connect device that plays on an AirPlay speaker (HomePod).
 Volume, Now Playing and the speaker controls work both ways. Needs Spotify Premium.
Maintainer: sui827
Author: sui827
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), preferenceloader
